# Lens profiles.
lens_profiles.invalid = Tànnal databasu Lensfun v1/v2 XML bu baax (ba 8 MiB) bu am done kamera walla lanti yu ñu nangu.
lens_profiles.calibration = Kalibaraasiyoŋu lanti
lens_profiles.no_calibration = Amul kalibaraasiyoŋ bu méngoo ak yii ayar. Seetal guddaayu focal ak coefficientu dog bu kamera bi; jubbanti ak loxo yi dafay des.
lens_profiles.import = Dugal Lensfun XML…
lens_profiles.imported = Duggal nañu databasu Lensfun ngir bii seetaan. Tànnal porofil walla nga méngale ko ak done yi ci foto bi.
lens_profiles.manual = Jubbanti ak loxo yi rekk
lens_profiles.saved = Kalibaraasiyoŋ bu ñu denc (databasu bi jàppandiwul)
lens_profiles.profile = Porofilu lanti
lens_profiles.aperture = Ubbiteefu lanti (0 = xameesul)
lens_profiles.distance = Sorewaayu focus (0 = xameesul)
lens_profiles.vignette = Lëndëmug pegg yi bu ñu kalibare
lens_profiles.color_context = Lëndëmug pegg yi bu ñu kalibare dafa soxla porofilu sRGB bi ci biir. Soppil ci sRGB ngir denc melokaan wi, te ubbiwaat Jubantig lanti. Su pixels yi nekkoon nañu sRGB waaye amuñu màndarga, jox leen sRGB doy na. Jubbantig melow ak melo yu wuute yi des nañu jàppandi.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = Amul kalibaraasiyoŋu lëndëmug pegg yi bu méngoo ak ubbiteef bi ak sorewaayu focus. Dugalal dayo yi nga natt ngir tàmbali ko; ci porofil Lensfun yu bare, 1000 m mooy focus bu sori.
lens_profiles.note = Jubbanti bu ñu kalibare day dox laata ayar yi ak loxo. Jëfandikool nataal bu njëkk bi yépp; dagg ko gannaaw. Dencal mbooleem ségal yi ci PSD/PSB ngir kalibaraasiyoŋ bi mana soppeeku.
lens_profiles.automatic = Méngale ak done yi ci foto bi
lens_profiles.components = Jëfandikoo porofil bi: dëngal {distortion}; pegg yu melo yu wuute {tca}; lëndëmug pegg yi {vignette}.
